                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Do you feel like milking your own cow? then this is possible in Cow Milking Simulator for virtual reality!\nTake a bucket and fill bucket after bucket with fresh milk until the cow is completely emptied, or until the time runs out of course because the game is played with a timer to be as fast as possible!\nYou can then save the buckets of milk until you have enough to develop a dairy product and you can then sell these products.\nIt is not without dangers, occasionally a UFO will try to steal your cow and you will have to chase it away by throwing things at it.\n\nWatch a snippet of gameplay here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jZvr_uPBSnk",
